<title>UK: TABLE-Wagon Industrial pretax profits fall.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Wagon Industrial pretax profits fall.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		  25.0		 vs    35.5</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	    5.0		 vs    12.75</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence)   12.0		 vs    19.75</p>
<p> Pre-tax			20.4*		vs    27.0</p>
<p> Turnover		    387.2		 vs   410.3</p>
<p>* NOTE - The pre-tax profits does not take into account exceptional charges which included diminution in value of goodwill and losses and provision for losses on closure and disposal of businesses. Wagon Industrial's pre-tax losses after exceptional charges and interest stood at 46.9 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Wagon Industrial Holdings Plc.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
